# Teacher plan waitlist (see README: Teacher plan waitlist). Copy to `.env` for local builds, or set them as build
# variables in Cloudflare (Workers & Pages -> earth-science-lab -> Settings -> Build -> Variables and secrets).
#
# Both must be set for anything to appear. While either is empty, the teachers page has no waitlist section, no
# Turnstile script loads, the after-share prompt is off and the privacy page leaves out its waitlist paragraph.

# The classroomlabs.org Worker's signup route: https://classroomlabs.org/api/waitlist once it is live.
PUBLIC_WAITLIST_ENDPOINT=
# Cloudflare Turnstile site key (public) for the widget on /teachers/. The secret key stays in the Worker.
PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=
